der\">\\n      <h1>Federal Grant Opportunities Digest</h1>\\n      <p>10 opportunities &middot; September 04, 2026</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\"domain\">Arts, Law and Social Sciences</div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/8ea93672-b51b-4e0e-b079-d97848c1f800\">BJA FY 2026 Bridging Immigration-Related Deficits Experienced Nationwide Program: Joint Task Force Crossroads America - Indiana Invitation to Apply</a><div class=\"summary\">Funds costs for personnel, travel, training, and equipment to address law enforcement related to criminal illegal aliens in Indiana.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Bureau of Justice Assistance</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-09-09</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $1,615,056</span></div></div><div class=\"domain\">Science, Technology, Engineering, Mathematics (STEM)</div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/9854b307-dff7-4f10-80dc-a760b9b3dbc2\">FY26 Atlantic Gateway, Arlington to Alexandria Fourth Track - CMAQ Funds</a><div class=\"summary\">Supports the construction of approximately six miles of new fourth track on the CSX Richmond, Fredericksburg, and Potomac Subdivision.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">DOT - Federal Railroad Administration</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-09-09</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $56,000,000</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/f3dbe036-5423-4d53-b381-ea49a2d76a40\">Outreach and Assistance for Veteran Farmers and Ranchers Program</a><div class=\"summary\">Assists Veterans in owning and operating farms and ranches and ensures their participation in USDA programs.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">National Institute of Food and Agriculture</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-09-10</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $1,500,000</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/9157af4e-c67b-4827-88a5-49149fa24a3d\">Request for Information - Gauging Investor Interest in the Development and Commercialization of Subsurface Energy Technologies</a><div class=\"summary\">Seeks to gauge investor interest in developing and commercializing subsurface energy technologies.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">National Energy Technology Laboratory</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-10-05</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $2</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/2cd66ca1-5db4-460a-953c-21a370cf3d1a\">Groundwater and Surficial Water Salinity Changes in Everglades National Park using Aerial Electromagnetic Surveys</a><div class=\"summary\">Focuses on studying groundwater and surficial water salinity changes in Everglades National Park using aerial electromagnetic surveys.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Fort Worth District</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-10-06</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $1,657,690</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/03297609-7453-4e82-8c53-ce31a0b42e28\">1890 Institution Teaching, Research, and Extension Capacity Building Grants Program</a><div class=\"summary\">Builds the teaching, research, and extension capacities of eligible 1890 institutions through cooperative programs.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">National Institute of Food and Agriculture</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-11-04</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $750,000</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/c3966c70-b343-4146-9946-608e95c11dff\">Accelerating Scale-up and Pre-piloting of Emerging Chemical Technologies (ASPECT)</a><div class=\"summary\">Supports research, development, and pre-pilot testing of innovative chemical technologies to enhance energy solutions.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Golden Field Office</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-12-01</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $20,000,000</span></div></div><div class=\"domain\">Health Sciences</div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/f03c1c58-6492-460f-9f19-11ac14ec5184\">DoW Breast Cancer, Clinical Research Extension Award</a><div class=\"summary\">Supports research that extends data collection and analysis of breast cancer clinical studies.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Defense Health Agency Contracting Activity - DHACA</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-11-18</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/5fab0e14-d356-49f6-97dd-3054f0271cda\">DoW Breast Cancer, Breakthrough Award Levels 1 and 2</a><div class=\"summary\">Funds promising research with high potential to lead to breakthroughs in breast cancer.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Defense Health Agency Contracting Activity - DHACA</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-11-18</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/be66c7b5-6a80-4b5f-98bf-b2424791e3f6\">Cancer Prevention and Control Programs for State, Territorial, and Tribal Organizations</a><div class=\"summary\">Develops and promotes effective strategies for preventing and controlling cancer through collaboration with various health organizations.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Centers for Disease Control - NCCDPHP</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2027-02-05</span></div></div>\\n    <div class=\"footer\">\\n      Generated automatically from the grants data pipeline.<br>\\n      Data source: simpler.grants.gov\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>', 'subject': 'Grant Opportunities Digest - 2026-09-04 (10 new)', 'count': 10, 'in